          "rPr": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "text": "Keywords are terms used in a dissertation for indexing, reflecting core information of the dissertation. An abstract may contain a maximum of 5 key words, with semi-colons used in between to separate one another. ",
